 a:['C16 (c) CONSTRAINT STATE (D-QG-005 condition QG-051-C6; D-ARCH-216; data-model 4.6 C16 as amended 2026-11-21; rulings section 8.12): TENANT_REFERENCES_SQL returns per foreign key the fact enforced = conenforced AND convalidated; the pure function reports a key that is not enforced whatever its columns, never counts it as org-bound, guest-bound or a sibling, and reports an exception entry that names it; a second assertion of the suite finds no constraint of a non-system schema (the scope of P9-CK) with conenforced or convalidated false, with no exception map; planted and reported, each rolled back: an org-bound key declared NOT ENFORCED, an org-bound key altered to NOT ENFORCED with ALTER CONSTRAINT, an org-bound key left NOT VALID, a guest-bound key declared NOT ENFORCED whose org-bound sibling is then reported as alone, an owner CHECK declared NOT ENFORCED and a CHECK left NOT VALID; fixtures in tenant-keys.test.ts drive the function; pg_constraint.conenforced exists from PostgreSQL 18 on, so the query fails on a PGlite 17 replay and is not adapted for it','C16 (d) REFERENTIAL ACTIONS (D-QG-005 condition QG-051-C1 (a); D-ARCH-215; ADR-0005 amendment 15 item 37 as clarified 2026-11-21; data-model 4.6 C16): no foreign key of a non-system schema has confdeltype or confupdtype other than r (RESTRICT), with no exception map; planted and reported, each rolled back: a key with ON UPDATE CASCADE, a key with ON DELETE SET NULL and a key that states no action (NO ACTION on both); not reported: the 13 keys of the merged migrations','MERGE ORDER (D-ARCH-216 owner and date; D-SD-011): starts when TASK-051 is on main (both tasks edit tenant-keys.ts) and merges before TASK-087 opens its PR (MERGE PREREQUISITE on TASK-087); the TASK-051 fix cycle does not take it','RIPPLE (D-ARCH-215): once this task is on main a migration whose foreign key states another action than RESTRICT, or states none, fails the catalog suite; Prisma defaults a relation to Cascade on update, so every relation of a later schema file states onDelete: Restrict and onUpdate: Restrict; the cards of TASK-087, TASK-092, TASK-154 and TASK-237 say so, and the handoff of this task names the rule for the orchestrator','PR051-SEC-06 (INFO, CWE-1023; D-SECPR051-02; D-QG-006 QG-051-C7 (a)): tenant-keys.ts returns the referencing and referenced column pairs as an array, not as joined text split on =, for the T2-O entry check and for the sibling comparison (the split at tenant-keys.ts lines 122, 223 and 239 at 39cac6e5); planted case: a quoted column "a=x" in the key and the CHECK on column a: the key is reported and the entry no longer hides it; control: the CHECK on the real column refuses the row (23514)','O7 TAG AND POSTGRESQL 18 MUTANTS (D-QG-006 QG-051-C7 (b) and (c); D-SECPR051-02; due before G3): this task adds [SEC-TC-79] to the title of O7 in prisma/tests/organisations/organisations.int.test.ts (title only, after TASK-051 is on main, so no binding of PR #83 is voided), runs the mutants of O1 and O7 of the TASK-051 code review (rounds 1 and 2, PR-0083-TASK-051-code-review.md) on PostgreSQL 18 in its lane B slot, and reports both as killed in its PR; qa-lead moves SEC-TC-79 (O1 to O7) into integration.required_cases after the TASK-051 merge'],
