// Shared hot files (sheet-fold 9; D-ORCH-118, D-ARCH-147). A card whose planned files (f) name a path that starts with one of
// these prefixes must hold the lock (gen.mjs fails otherwise), so two tasks that edit the file never share a batch and the
// back-fill rule of PLAN.md section 6 rule 3 (locks are free) keeps two in-flight PRs off it. A PR that needs such a file without
// the lock stops and asks the orchestrator for it first. Prefixes ending in a dot cover the file and its tests.
